                    <div class="c-event__content">

                        <div class="c-event__title">
                            <span>專屬好禮</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="c-event__date">2025/7/11~2025/9/30</div>
                        <div class="c-event__text">新朋友首刷加碼禮自由選</div>
                        <div class="c-event__info">
